            "review_title": "Review at O Lounge, Bistro and Sport Bar",
            "review_text": "Juancito de Ka\n3 contributions\n0\nNot proper information lack of staff knowledge. As per Dubai market\nSep 2020 • Couples\nWe came to celebrate our 1st anniversary we book under emirates platinum discount, while booking they said 299 for one pax and 50% discount on normal Package after having the brunch ( no doubts the food and service was good ) but lack of information while they book the table. ( Rana ) After arriving and having Burch they said it’s not valid for 50 % on normal package u have to take premium package after we drinks and had food ( I like what ?) anyways they wake up after we 6.15 pm that’s not the way we ask ok can you change the package they change only for 1 person widout even giving premium beverages. Not discount on bill. We just don’t want to argue or ruin our lovely day. So we paid it left. End of the day that’s the way there is plenty of places in dubai where we can have an amazing time and good view. I won’t recommend this kind of place to anyone.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 25, 2020",
